Looking to customize AV rental packages in Malaga? Our packages are not a build-your-own equipment catalog: each one is a fixed base, delivered, installed and tested by our crew, with a short, defined list of add-ons on top. Here is exactly what you can add to each package, and what a price tag it carries.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests every package across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear's packages customize through a defined add-on menu, not an open equipment catalog. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test the base package, then add whatever is on the list below.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Key Highlights

---

Malaga Event Gear's packages customize through real, priced add-ons.

-   The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) adds a projector and screen (+50 euros) or a smoke machine (+20 euros).

-   The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) adds a dedicated on-site technician (+240 euros per day).

-   The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) adds an extra technician hour (+40 euros), a lectern (+50 euros) or modular staging (+35 euros per square meter).

-   The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) ship as a fixed configuration, with no listed add-ons.

## What You Can Actually Add

Three of our five packages have a real add-on list. Here is exactly what is on it:

-   **Eco Pack**: a projector and projection screen (+50 euros), or a professional smoke or fog machine (+20 euros).
-   **Basic MICE Pack**: a dedicated on-site live technical assistant for the day (+240 euros).
-   **MICE Pack**: an additional hour of on-site technical support beyond the included six (+40 euros per hour), a premium methacrylate lectern (+50 euros), or modular staging platforms (+35 euros per square meter).

See exact, current pricing for every add-on on our [packages page](/packages/).

<InlineCTA />

## Packages That Don't Flex

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) do not have a listed add-on menu: they ship as the configuration described on their package page, with a technician included on the Wedding Pack and none on Product Presentation. If your event needs something outside either package's real inclusions, [contact us](/contact/) directly rather than assuming it can be added.

## Connecting Your Own Devices

This is not a paid add-on, but it is worth knowing: the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces at no extra cost, so you can connect your own laptop, tablet or media player to the screen and sound system.

