## FAQs

### What can I actually add to an AV rental package?

It depends on the package. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) adds a projector and screen or a smoke machine. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) adds a dedicated technician. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) adds extra technician hours, a lectern or staging. See [What You Can Actually Add](#what-you-can-actually-add) above.

### Which packages can't be customized?

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) ship as a fixed configuration, with no listed add-on menu. See [Packages That Don't Flex](#packages-that-dont-flex) above.

### Can I add a technician to a package that doesn't include one?

Yes, on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), a dedicated on-site technician is available for 240 euros per day. The Wedding Pack and MICE Pack already include one.

### Can I add a lectern or staging to a corporate package?

Yes, both are add-ons on the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/): a methacrylate lectern for 50 euros, and modular staging for 35 euros per square meter.

### Is a projector available as an add-on?

Yes, on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), a projector and projection screen can be added for 50 euros.

### Are adapters for my own laptop included, or are they an extra cost?

They are included at no extra cost on the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/): HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces come with the package.

### How much does it cost to add extra technician hours?

On the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), an additional hour of on-site technical support beyond the included six costs 40 euros. All prices are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout.

### What if I need something that isn't on any package's add-on list?

Contact us directly. We do not add equipment or services outside a package's real inclusions and listed add-ons without confirming it first.
